riests. Returning from exile aboard a colossal satellite fortress guided by an artificial intelligence, the Doom Slayer sets out to break Hell's grip on Earth. Driven by relentless fury and armed to the teeth, he wages a one-man war against the demonic horde, hunting down the Hell Priests to unravel the invasion and avert humanity's extinction.", "summary": "As the Doom Slayer you return to find Earth has suffered a demonic invasion. Discover the Slayer\u2019s origins and his enduring mission to Raze Hell.\n\nThe Doom Eternal Deluxe Edition includes:\nYear One Pass with two campaign add-ons.\nDemonic Slayer Skin.\nClassic Weapon Sound Pack.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 17, "name": "Fantasy"}, {"id": 18, "name": "Science fiction"}, {"id": 19, "name": "Horror"}, {"id": 39, "name": "Warfare"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/doom-eternal-deluxe-edition", "videos": [{"id": 193866, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "l9E46roQn8I", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=l9E46roQn8I", "title": "DOOM Eternal | Trailer [GOG]", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/l9E46roQn8I/sddefault.jpg"}]}